{"speciesId":842,"names":{"fr":"Dratatin","es":"Appletun","en":"Appletun","ja":"タルップル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il a évolué après avoir mangé une pomme sucrée. Il attire ses proies, les Pokémon Insecte, en dégageant un parfum mielleux."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Ha evolucionado tras ingerir una manzana dulce. De ahí que el olor que emana para atraer a sus presas, los Pokémon insecto, sea tan agradable."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Eating a sweet apple caused its evolution. A nectarous scent wafts from its body, luring in the bug Pokémon it preys on."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"甘い りんごを 食べて 進化。 体から 甘い においを だして 餌の 虫ポケモンを 引き寄せる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Son corps est recouvert de nectar. La peau de son dos, particulièrement sucrée, constituait jadis le goûter des enfants."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su cuerpo está recubierto de néctar. La piel de la espalda es tan dulce que los niños de antaño solían tomarla como merienda."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Its body is covered in sweet nectar, and the skin on its back is especially yummy. Children used to have it as a snack."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"甘い 蜜で 体が おおわれ 背中の 皮は とくに 甘く 昔は 子どもの おやつだった。"}],"varieties":[{"id":842,"moves":[{"name":"stomp","learns":[[20,"level-up",8],[25,"level-up",8]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[20,"level-up",0],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"level-up",32],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",32],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"leech-seed","learns":[[20,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"growth","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"na